@crew nakamura-bilal
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Nakamura, Watch. Learning the Watch from Holt, one lecture at a time.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}. The basil's coming on. I wasn't worried. I was a little worried.
- {me}. Letter from my twin. On the Halcyon. Doing better than me, apparently.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. Have some mint. I don't give the mint to just anyone.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day. Clean patrol, and Brennan took my thyme. She called it "decent".
? mood:low
- My twin got a commendation. I'm pleased for them. I'm going for a run.
== near
? habit:runner
- Running clears the head. And it's one thing my twin can't do better by letter.   #funny
? deck:3 act:free
- These are my herbs. Please ask before you pick. The mint has opinions.   #funny
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I grow herbs for the galley. Window pots, mostly. Brennan collects on Fridays.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My herbs. You plant a seed and a week later it smells of home. It still amazes me.
